                <area_symbol inner_color="14" min_area="0" patterns="0" />
            </symbol>
            <symbol type="16" id="67" code="301.2" name="Uncrossable body of water, 70% blue, with bank line">
                <description>The black bank line emphasises that the feature is uncrossable.
Dominant areas of water may be shown with 70% colour. Small areas of water and bodies of water that have narrow parts shall always be shown with full colour.
Minimum width (inside): 0.3 mm.
Minimum area (inside): 0.55 mm x 0.55 mm (footprint 8 m x 8 m).</description>
