            <symbol type="16" id="123" code="501" name="Paved area, with bounding line">
                <description>An area with a firm surface such as asphalt, hard gravel, tiles, concrete or the like. Paved areas should be bordered (or framed) by a thin black line where they have a distinct boundary.
