            <symbol type="2" id="133" code="504" name="Vehicle Track">
                <description>A track or poorly maintained road suitable for vehicles only when travelling
slowly. 
For distinct junctions the dashes of the symbols are joined at the junction.

For indistinct junctions the dashes of the symbols are not joined.

Minimum length (isolated): two dashes (6.25 mm - footprint 94 m).
</description>
