                <description>An easily runnable path, bicycle track or old vehicle track.

For distinct junctions the dashes of the symbols are joined at the junction. For indistinct junctions the dashes of the symbols are not joined.

Minimum length (isolated): two dashes (4.25 mm - footprint 64 m)
                </description>
                <line_symbol color="2" line_width="250" minimum_length="4250" join_style="1" cap_style="0" start_offset="0" end_offset="0" dashed="true" segment_length="4000" end_length="0" show_at_least_one_symbol="true" minimum_mid_symbol_count="0" minimum_mid_symbol_count_when_closed="0" dash_length="2000" break_length="250" dashes_in_group="1" in_group_break_length="500" mid_symbols_per_spot="1" mid_symbol_distance="0" />
