            <symbol type="2" id="135" code="506" name="Small footpath">
                <description>A runnable small path or (temporary) forest extraction track which can be followed
at competition speed.

For distinct junctions the dashes of the symbols are joined at the junction. For indistinct junctions the dashes of the symbols are not joined.

Minimum length (isolated): two dashes (2.25 mm - footprint 34 m).
</description>
